      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-guts-2016-p1.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Answer: \\(\\sqrt{\\sqrt{10}}\\)\nWe have \\((x-y)^{2}+(x+y)^{2}=2\\left(x^{2}+y^{2}\\right)\\), so \\((x-y)^{2}=10\\), hence \\(|x-y|=\\sqrt{10}\\).",
